## 🧠 Clear-the-Fog Protocol: Eradicating Mental Fatigue
Brain fog is a symptom of neuroinflammation, oxidative stress, or unstable glucose curves. Use these target inputs to restore focus:

* 
* Brain-Boosting Nutrients: Choline (the structural building block for the memory neurotransmitter acetylcholine), Omega-3 Fatty Acids (EPA/DHA) to reduce neural inflammation, and Flavonoids to boost blood flow directly to the hippocampus.
* The Foods: Wild-caught salmon, sardines, whole pasture-raised eggs, blueberries, walnuts, and dark chocolate (70%+ cocoa).
* Natural Supplements: Lion’s Mane mushroom (stimulates Nerve Growth Factor for neural repair), L-Theanine (pairs perfectly with morning caffeine to sharpen attention without jitters), and Magnesium L-Threonate (the only magnesium form that efficiently crosses the blood-brain barrier).
* Targeted Exercises: Vinyasa Yoga or Pike-Up drills to reverse blood pooling and increase cerebral perfusion, paired with Zone 2 Cardio (45 minutes of steady aerobic output where you can talk but not sing) to skyrocket Brain-Derived Neurotrophic Factor (BDNF).
