## 🥗 The Dietary Blueprint for Optimal Vitals
To keep your top 20 biological markers perfectly balanced, structure your eating habits around these highly researched dietary frameworks:

* 
* The Mediterranean & MIND Diets: Built heavily around extra virgin olive oil, green leafy vegetables, nuts, berries, and fish. These protocols are clinically proven to slash system-wide inflammation (CRP) and lower dangerous LDL cholesterol.
* Intermittent Fasting (16:8 Protocol): Limiting consumption to an 8-hour daily window allows insulin levels to drop cleanly, reversing insulin resistance and driving Fasting Glucose down to optimal levels.
