## ⚠️ The Saboteurs: Questionable Foods, Greases, & Depleting Supplements
Many everyday habits actively damage cognitive function while quietly causing nutrient deficiencies:

* 
* Industrial "Grease" & Trans Fats: Hydrogenated oils, fast-food fryer grease, and commercial margarine induce heavy systemic inflammation, narrowing the microscopic blood vessels supplying the brain and drastically elevating the risk of cognitive decline.
* Ultra-Processed Food Additives: High-fructose corn syrup and artificial sweeteners (found heavily in commercial protein powders or diet sodas) alter your gut microbiome. Because your gut produces a massive portion of your neurotransmitters, this disruption directly triggers brain fog and sleep disorders.
* The Glucose Rollercoaster: Foods made with refined white flour and added sugars cause massive spikes and crashes in blood glucose. These steep drops deprive brain cells of stable energy, leaving you mentally exhausted 2 hours after a meal.
* Nutrient-Sapping Cleanse Supplements: Overusing aggressive herbal detoxes, unregulated laxative teas, or massive doses of isolated minerals (like zinc without copper balance) can irritate the intestinal lining, actively washing out crucial water-soluble vitamins like B12 and folate before your body can absorb them.

